ssion-level displacement. If compulsory licensing didn't prevent consolidation in music over 116 years, what specific structural feature of the proposed rate-setting body would produce a different outcome for AI training? And if input-level manifests face the same international enforcement gap as distribution-layer controls, on what basis is one called \"universal\" and the other \"insufficient\"?",
